Look, I’ve gotta give it to you—you've been handling the Fraud Detection queue like a pro these past three weeks.
The President even took notice of how low our flagged false-positives have been. But you know how things go around here... clean up one pile, get handed a bigger one.
Now that you know the ins and outs of Fraud detection, we’re now gonna introduce you to KYC, Know Your Customer.
Back in the old paper days, Mr. Angilo used to look people in the eye, check their physical ID cards, and match their signatures himself. Now that we're strictly digital, people try all kinds of tricks—fake IDs, stolen credentials, mismatched face scans, you name it.
Your terminal has now access to KYC, your digital assistant will Assist you there. Good luck.